## SERVICE_PENDING (compose_flip.rs)

No name to remove: this task registers no service.

## Consumers (later tasks, not edited here)

* nr-office-pdf-images (pdf-draw.mjs embedImage): `mixdog_raster::svg::rasterize_logo(&fonts, bytes)` is rasterizeSvg: it answers the
  declared size (the placement) and the PNG pixels (`Logo::image.to_png()`); a failure's message is what the caller prefixes with
  "PDF could not read the SVG <path>: ". The `looksLikeSvg` test (extension .svg, or `<svg[\s>]` in the first 512 bytes) stays with the caller.
* the pptx kit and HTML build: `svg::rasterize(&fonts, svg, 72.0)` is png(svg); `svg::rasterize_to(&fonts, svg, 180.0, round(w * 2.5), round(h * 2.5))`
  is addSvg. `SvgFonts::from_registry(&proof, &registry)` is built once per registry and cloned (it is an Arc).
